# The build context is the repository root, so this is what never needs to
# reach the daemon. `turbo prune` narrows it further inside the build; this is
# about what is worth sending in the first place.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.ingot-data
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.DS_Store
